{% set local_problem %}
<p>Cullman's housing stock tells the story of a community that builds to last. From the historic homes near downtown to the well-maintained neighborhoods throughout the county, there's an expectation of quality here that extends to every aspect of home maintenance.</p>

<p>Traditional sectional gutters don't meet that standard. Made from 10-foot sections joined together, they have seams every 10 feet that eventually leak, catch debris, and look increasingly shabby over time. For homes that are otherwise meticulously maintained, failing gutters stand out — and not in a good way.</p>

<p>Seamless gutters match Cullman's quality expectations. Custom-fabricated to fit your specific roofline, they eliminate the weak points where sectional gutters fail. The result is cleaner appearance, better performance, and longer life — exactly what quality-conscious Cullman homeowners want.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Seamless gutters are manufactured from a continuous roll of aluminum, formed on-site to the exact length required for each run of your home. Instead of pre-cut 10-foot sections joined together, you get one continuous piece from corner to corner.</p>

<p>We bring our portable gutter machine directly to your Cullman home. We feed in aluminum coil — available in 20+ colors — and produce gutters custom-cut to your specifications. The result is a precision fit that looks better and performs better than off-the-shelf alternatives.</p>

<p>For historic homes, we also offer half-round gutters that provide period-appropriate appearance while delivering modern performance. Whatever your home's style, we'll help you choose gutters that complement rather than compromise its character.</p>
{% endset %}

